      "content": "Fair enough, but if we're being totally honest and looking at the raw data sets most people talk about, can you just lay out the specific arguments they make about different groups? Like, instead of the critique, what are the actual claims they make regarding specific ethnic groups and their cognitive traits? I just want to see the actual perspective they're arguing for without the immediate debunking.",
